        "content": "## Duplicate Detection & Risk Scoring\nPerforms exact and fuzzy invoice matching, calculates duplicate risk scores, and uses AI to evaluate potential duplicate payment risks."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "671ec3b7-9f01-4ff3-8471-4cf55f9485ec",
